(
    title: "Q*bert\'s Qubes",
    developer: Some("Todd Marshall"),
    description: Some("Rows of cubes hang in space, and hopping Q*bert off one tumbles it to a new colour face. Match a row of four to the target cube shown at the top left and the round is won; later levels need two or three rows, and Shoobops can undo a match you have already made, as can a careless hop of your own."),
